    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This stout frame has served the guards of Minas Tirith and the archers of Carn Dum alike. It strikes with a forceful impact that pierces deeply through thick leather and mail. The mechanism offers a reliable, solid thud for every bolt sent into the fray."
